      "text": "#LAGOS-IBADAN EXPRESSWAY*\n#TrafficUpdate\n\n *SITUATION* :\n *Section:lBD - LAG (Inbound LAGOS)* \n\n1)MFM to Magboro : Vehicular movement is good for now. \n\n2) Magboro to Arepo: From Magboro to Arepo is also better for now. \n\nArepo to Warewa is looking good at the moment.\n\n3 Warewa to Fatgbems : Vehicular movement from Warewa to Longbridge Mikano is having good vehicular movement for now.\n\n Mikano to Petals ( red roof) is also having better movement at the moment. \n\nMIKANO to Hogan Guard company is also good for now. \n\nHogan Guard company to Petals (red roof) , Elalan company and Compass House are still enjoying free flow of traffic at the moment. \n\n4) Compass House to Tribune House experiencing free vehicular movement at the moment. \n\nVehicular movement from Tribune House to Fatgbems is moving fine for now. \n\n5)Fatgbems to kara is  having slow vehicular movement at the moment due to on going expansion joint work at Kara bridge by CBS construction company. \n\n6). Kara bridge to New Garage is having good vehicular  movement at the moment.\n\nSection :LAG - lBD\n(Outbound LAGOS)\n\n1)New Garage to Kara: Experiencing good movement for now. \n\n2) Fatgbems to Longbridge: Vehicular movement from fatgbems to longbridge is better movement at the moment. \n\n3) Warewa to Punch is better vehicular movement at the moment. \n\n4) Punch to MFM is free for vehicular movement.\n\nTRACE Operatives are on ground monitoring the traffic.",
